§§ `R2 — the Fund supports the driver who caused the accident, insured or not`

-- The owner of an uninsured motorbike, who broke the duty to insure, crashes alone and dies: his
-- heirs' claim is case (2). The driver of an insured car crashes alone and is injured at 85%:
-- outside the scope of Article 7(1) (neither a third party nor a passenger), case (3).
