§§ `R3 — one death, paid twice by the Fund`

-- An unlicensed driver kills a pedestrian. Within 3 working days, scope not yet found, the
-- insurer advances 30% of the limit (Article 12(3)(b)). The accident is then found excluded
-- under Article 7(2)(c): the Fund repays the insurer 45,000,000, and the pedestrian's heirs are
-- in case (4) for 45,000,000 of humanitarian support. Nothing nets the one against the other or
-- asks for the advance back.
