-- src:498 | thiệt hại của người bị thiệt hại) với mức hỗ trợ cụ thể như sau: 30% giới hạn trách
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person with` `death` `harmed by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `Article 7(2)(a): an intentional act of the injured person`))) EQUALS RIGHT `no support: none of the cases of Article 17(1)(a)`
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person with` `death` `harmed by` (LIST `an identified vehicle with no compulsory insurance in force`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the vehicle was not insured`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person with` `death` `harmed by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the vehicle that caused the accident was not identified`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made` `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` (`an advance under` `point (b): the accident had not yet been found within the scope of compensation` `for` `death` `of` 45000000 `, later` `excluded under Article 7(2)`) EQUALS RIGHT (`the Fund must repay` 45000000)

§§ `R5 — support on top of compensation where one of two vehicles was uninsured`

-- A pedestrian is killed by two vehicles. The insured one's insurer covers its share (Article
-- 12(6)(a), by degree of fault, row VN-10); the other was uninsured. Case (2) holds (fork V8):
-- 45,000,000 of support besides the insurer's compensation.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person with` `death` `harmed by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `the insurer covers the harm`), `an identified vehicle with no compulsory insurance in force`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the vehicle was not insured`)

