§§ `R7 — a shared ceiling, a carry-over for support only, and a Fund the Council may leave empty`

-- Article 16(1) sets a ceiling on the contribution ("tối đa 1%") and no floor: a rate of 0 is
-- lawful, and so is an empty Fund. With no contributions and no balance, point (a) may spend
-- nothing: every support file is carried, year after year.
