§§ `R8 — the emergency releases the balance to the police, rewards, database, ASEAN and administration, not to humanitarian support`

-- On premiums of 10,000,000,000,000 and a Council rate of 0.5%, the contributions are
-- 50,000,000,000 and points (d) to (h) may spend 38% of them, 19,000,000,000. In an emergency
-- the balance of earlier years may be spent on those same points up to 38% of a 1% contribution,
-- 38,000,000,000, twice what they had; points (a) to (c) get nothing from point (i).
